<title>GREECE: TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 407 bps, 310 vs BTP.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Greek/Bund gap widens to 407 bps, 310 vs BTP.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The spread of Greece's 10-year bond over bunds widened to 407 basis points on Tuesday from Monday's 401.</p>
<p>But the Greek/BTP gap narrowed to 310 basis points from 316 on Monday.</p>
<p>		 CPN     MATURITY  YIELDS    SPREADS    PREVIOUS</p>
<p>								    SPREADS</p>
<p>   GREECE    8.80%   25JUN07    9.60%</p>
<p>   GERMANY   6.00%   04JUL07    5.54%	407	401 bps</p>
<p>   FRANCE    5.50%   25APR07    5.45%	415	419 bps</p>
<p>   ITALY     6.75%   01FEB07    6.50%	310	316 bps</p>
<p>   PORTUGAL  6.63%   23FEB07    6.23%	337	336 bps</p>
<p>   SPAIN     7.35%   31MAR07    6.16%	344	342 bps</p>
<p>   UK	  7.25%   07DEC07    7.08%	252	254 bps</p>
<p>   US	  6.63%   15MAY07    6.22%	338	332 bps</p>
<p>All yields are annualised and based on bid prices at 0905 GMT. --Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
